From de26cb1e419c9f3f2b4aac5776ab7de83ecd7268 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maru <childerolando@look.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 06:08:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded native inline field correction audit route

Reuse the 79-cn exact-field correction pattern for native inline PDF
pages: a page-scoped root acceptance lists the revision candidate hash,
the preserved production raw, the parent candidate and the failed audit.
The audit rebuilds every approved field from the untouched raw, keeps all
unlisted fields bound field-by-field to it, requires source crop evidence
and must still pass a fresh independent review of the revision candidate.
